sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant CMP as Component.razor (WASM)
    participant HTTPC as Typed HttpClient
    participant BFF as BFF Middleware
    participant EP as Minimal API Endpoint
    participant HND as Feature Handler
    participant AI as CV · OpenAI · Gemini
    participant TS as Table Storage

    U->>CMP: Click "Analyze"
    CMP->>HTTPC: POST /api/images/analyze<br/>X-Session-ID · X-Correlation-ID
    HTTPC->>BFF: HTTPS + cookie
    BFF->>BFF: Auth · Correlation · RateLimit · Exception
    BFF->>EP: route
    EP->>HND: AnalyzeAsync(request)
    HND->>AI: CV → OpenAI → Gemini
    AI-->>HND: result
    HND-->>EP: ImageAnalysisResponse
    EP-->>CMP: 200 → render
    opt Save
        CMP->>HTTPC: POST /api/user-images/result
        HTTPC->>BFF: HTTPS
        BFF->>HND: SaveResultAsync
        HND->>TS: InsertOrReplace (PK=UserId, RK=Guid)
        TS-->>CMP: 201 → gallery refresh
    end